Interview Questions for DevOps Roles (5+ Years Experience)

Below are the questions 👇

1) What is a NAT Gateway, and how does it work?
2) If an EC2 instance has 50GB storage, how do you attach extra storage to an existing instance?
3) If the pipeline fails due to pods starting and stopping, who will fix the issue?
4) How do you pass the port in Docker when writing a Dockerfile?
5) What is CMD and ENTRYPOINT in Docker?
6) Which deployment strategies have you worked on, and what is Blue-Green deployment?
7) How do you migrate Jenkins from one server to another?
8) What is Terraform drift?
9) If two people are working on the same Terraform module, how does it work?10) How do you remove a Terraform lock file so the next person can apply?
11) If someone created a resource from the AWS console, how do you sync it with the current Terraform state?
12) How does it work internally when you apply a Kubernetes manifest file?
13) What is taint and toleration in Kubernetes?
14) What load balancers are you using in Kubernetes, and why are you using them in your project?
